{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺有兒童懷疑猝死。今日（17日）清晨6時許，警方接獲吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名男子報案，指其11歲兒子在單位內昏迷不醒。</p><p>救護員接報到場，證實男童已明顯死亡；警方現正調查事件。</p><figure><img alt=\"粉嶺吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名11歲男童昏迷，當場證實不治。（Google街景截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261017/1188021971502239744632741.jpeg/Dj6IFMuzbvattvuUcUzpMCODDtDzQX2LiK5-x4iufsc\"/><figcaption>粉嶺吉祥街8號欣翠花園一名11歲男童昏迷，當場證實不治。（Google街景截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T23:19:00.799674+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T23:03:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T23:57:34.401202+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T23:17:34.297670+00:00","content_hash":"469e1dc87de024f34b38b3157c42be101b1668aae82ed8ea269322bb60706db6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}